2133
00:04:19,327 --> 00:04:20,657
<i>What...?</i>

2134
00:04:20,657 --> 00:04:21,407
<i>Who...?</i>

2135
00:04:21,947 --> 00:04:23,367
Yes, that's it.

2136
00:04:23,367 --> 00:04:26,247
Yes, you're a clever one, Pino.

2137
00:04:28,577 --> 00:04:29,747
<i>Pino...</i>

2138
00:04:34,207 --> 00:04:36,087
<i>It's hot here.</i>

2139
00:04:36,467 --> 00:04:38,887
Dorothy, please turn on the AC-

2140
00:04:57,107 --> 00:04:58,317
You are...

2141
00:04:59,357 --> 00:05:01,367
the infected autoreiv!

2142
00:05:14,497 --> 00:05:16,207
For a time,

2143
00:05:16,207 --> 00:05:17,877
not moving in the slightest,

2144
00:05:17,877 --> 00:05:20,297
I felt the indescribably immense tide,

2145
00:05:20,297 --> 00:05:22,547
the serenity of the vast sky,

2146
00:05:22,547 --> 00:05:25,467
and the melancholy of the hour

2147
00:05:25,467 --> 00:05:28,937
spread pleasantly through every fiber of my being.

2148
00:05:45,117 --> 00:05:47,747
That... was a waking dream.

2149
00:05:50,997 --> 00:05:52,327
This isn't what it seems!

2150
00:05:52,747 --> 00:05:55,587
In the end, once an immigrant, always an immigrant.

2151
00:06:10,307 --> 00:06:11,687
...by yourself.

2152
00:06:17,777 --> 00:06:20,527
God, it was a terrible dream.

2153
00:06:20,527 --> 00:06:24,697
The Security Bureau mistook me for your killer, Dorothy.

2154
00:06:24,697 --> 00:06:26,907
What a ridiculous nightmare.

2155
00:06:26,907 --> 00:06:28,407
Don't you agree, Dorothy?

2156
00:06:28,697 --> 00:06:30,497
As if I'd-

2157
00:06:41,917 --> 00:06:44,427
Don't suck up to an Entourage.

2158
00:06:44,427 --> 00:06:46,217
Dorothy's gone.

2159
00:06:47,427 --> 00:06:50,017
You cannot become a model citizen.

2160
00:06:56,517 --> 00:06:58,477
I do not know

2161
00:06:58,937 --> 00:07:01,317
what happened within my psyche,

2162
00:07:01,317 --> 00:07:03,697
nor am I able to express what did happen.

2163
00:07:04,317 --> 00:07:05,487
I...

2164
00:07:06,817 --> 00:07:08,027
I...

2165
00:07:08,327 --> 00:07:10,117
As a model citizen...

2166
00:07:10,117 --> 00:07:12,157
I've been trying very hard

2167
00:07:12,157 --> 00:07:13,957
to become a model citizen.

2168
00:07:13,957 --> 00:07:15,037
I...

2169
00:07:17,457 --> 00:07:19,247
You are a criminal,

2170
00:07:19,247 --> 00:07:20,707
Vincent Law.

2171
00:07:20,707 --> 00:07:21,587
No!

2172
00:07:26,297 --> 00:07:27,797
That is reality.

2173
00:07:35,807 --> 00:07:37,147
Help me!

2174
00:07:37,727 --> 00:07:41,727
That moment, when you felt something go to sleep within you

2175
00:07:41,727 --> 00:07:44,277
and something awakened,

2176
00:07:46,317 --> 00:07:51,077
was a moment that defied description.

2177
00:08:12,427 --> 00:08:15,057
In that world born of him,

2178
00:08:15,057 --> 00:08:18,097
everyone could become anything they wanted to be.

2179
00:08:19,147 --> 00:08:20,977
Those are Joe Bousquet's words.

2180
00:08:20,977 --> 00:08:21,897
Who?

2181
00:08:24,437 --> 00:08:26,187
Joe Bousquet.

2182
00:08:26,187 --> 00:08:27,237
Joe...

2183
00:08:28,697 --> 00:08:30,117
You are Vincent Law, correct?

2184
00:08:31,277 --> 00:08:32,327
Where am I...?

2185
00:08:32,947 --> 00:08:34,737
There's nothing to worry about.

2186
00:08:34,737 --> 00:08:37,207
Your body overcame the virus.

2187
00:08:37,827 --> 00:08:40,707
Though, that was really due to my treatment.

2188
00:08:43,497 --> 00:08:45,507
Eighty percent of the people who come here

2189
00:08:45,507 --> 00:08:48,217
are infected and last barely a week.

2190
00:08:49,217 --> 00:08:50,797
Infected...

2191
00:08:51,717 --> 00:08:52,597
Indeed.

2192
00:08:52,597 --> 00:08:55,097
You've been sleeping for ten days.

2193
00:08:55,807 --> 00:08:57,227
You're fine now.

2194
00:08:57,557 --> 00:08:58,937
Ten...

2195
00:08:59,597 --> 00:09:02,437
I heard many things during that time...

2196
00:09:03,107 --> 00:09:04,187
from Pino.

2197
00:09:06,147 --> 00:09:07,437
Ah, there you are, Pino.

2198
00:09:07,437 --> 00:09:09,777
Vincent is awake.

2199
00:09:11,157 --> 00:09:12,197
Vince!

2200
00:09:12,197 --> 00:09:13,237
Good morning!

2201
00:09:14,447 --> 00:09:15,867
I'm glad,

2202
00:09:17,037 --> 00:09:18,247
Vince.

2203
00:09:19,707 --> 00:09:21,577
Pi... no.

2204
00:09:25,917 --> 00:09:28,257
The autoreivs' escape route...

2205
00:09:44,267 --> 00:09:47,857
No wonder the Security Bureau guys can't find it.

2206
00:10:06,997 --> 00:10:07,957
Um...

2207
00:10:09,007 --> 00:10:10,207
Joe-san.

2208
00:10:11,547 --> 00:10:12,427
Joe?

2209
00:10:13,087 --> 00:10:14,007
Joe...

2210
00:10:16,967 --> 00:10:18,097
Joe...

2211
00:10:23,977 --> 00:10:25,187
Joe!

2212
00:10:27,187 --> 00:10:28,857
Ah, please excuse me.

2213
00:10:30,187 --> 00:10:32,527
No, I am Hoody.

2214
00:10:32,527 --> 00:10:34,737
Joe is a poet from Carcassonne.

2215
00:10:52,547 --> 00:10:54,257
Why are you...

2216
00:10:54,797 --> 00:10:56,887
so nice to someone like me?

2217
00:10:57,427 --> 00:10:59,257
You'll get into trouble too...

2218
00:11:00,507 --> 00:11:02,137
We were also once protected

2219
00:11:02,137 --> 00:11:05,517
with warmth, tolerance, and security

2220
00:11:06,137 --> 00:11:07,267
in that place.

2221
00:11:09,267 --> 00:11:13,187
The city must still be as beautiful as it has always been, no?

2222
00:11:14,027 --> 00:11:15,277
That city...

2223
00:11:15,277 --> 00:11:17,277
Everything's a big fat lie!

2224
00:11:17,567 --> 00:11:21,277
Lies are truth until you know them to be lies.

2225
00:11:21,277 --> 00:11:25,457
It may be the right thing to do to discern truth from lies,

2226
00:11:25,457 --> 00:11:28,247
but that does not mean it will bring happiness.

2227
00:11:29,167 --> 00:11:30,957
Are lies happiness?

2228
00:11:30,957 --> 00:11:32,547
Are lies happiness?

2229
00:11:33,047 --> 00:11:34,547
That's right.

2230
00:11:34,547 --> 00:11:36,047
You're a clever child, Pino.

2231
00:11:36,047 --> 00:11:37,507
Let me take a good look at you.

2232
00:11:38,757 --> 00:11:40,177
Wonderful.

2233
00:11:40,177 --> 00:11:43,557
So, autoreivs are becoming more and more like us after all.

2234
00:11:44,637 --> 00:11:48,057
Are these types common over there now?

2235
00:11:48,057 --> 00:11:49,227
"Over there"?

2236
00:11:49,727 --> 00:11:50,937
What are you talking about?

2237
00:11:51,307 --> 00:11:53,187
About Romdeau.

2238
00:11:54,437 --> 00:11:55,937
"Romdeau..."

2239
00:11:55,937 --> 00:11:57,737
It makes me nostalgic.

2240
00:11:57,737 --> 00:11:59,197
Wait a minute.

2241
00:11:59,567 --> 00:12:01,197
This isn't the immigrant sector?!

2242
00:12:08,367 --> 00:12:10,457
Why am I still alive?

2243
00:12:10,457 --> 00:12:13,127
Why are you asking the obvious?

2244
00:12:13,747 --> 00:12:16,707
You escaped out of the dome with her, didn't you?

2245
00:12:16,707 --> 00:12:18,877
"Out of the dome"?

2246
00:12:18,877 --> 00:12:20,337
Yes, yes!

2247
00:12:20,337 --> 00:12:22,007
I know!

2248
00:12:22,007 --> 00:12:26,637
The dome is 1246.65 units away from here.

2249
00:12:27,057 --> 00:12:32,147
And the distance from the ground to
 the plugvent Vince jumped down from

2250
00:12:32,147 --> 00:12:34,897
is approximately 517 units.

2251
00:12:35,267 --> 00:12:37,397
I took a good look and asked around,

2252
00:12:37,397 --> 00:12:39,607
so I know a whole lot!

2253
00:12:39,607 --> 00:12:41,237
Aren't I wonderful?

2254
00:12:41,237 --> 00:12:42,657
Right, Vince?

2255
00:12:45,327 --> 00:12:46,407
Vince...

2256
00:12:50,577 --> 00:12:51,707
Outside...

2257
00:12:52,287 --> 00:12:53,417
of Romdeau...

2258
00:12:54,707 --> 00:12:55,917
Vince!

2259
00:13:29,407 --> 00:13:31,207
You seem kind of down.

2260
00:13:31,207 --> 00:13:34,167
Maybe it's due to an injury from the last treatment.

2261
00:13:34,997 --> 00:13:37,287
Or maybe it's because you got fired by the Representative.

2262
00:13:37,877 --> 00:13:40,087
They even took Iggy away.

2263
00:13:40,087 --> 00:13:41,167
That's cruel of them.

2264
00:13:41,167 --> 00:13:42,257
No.

2265
00:13:42,757 --> 00:13:44,087
It's not because of that.

2266
00:13:44,087 --> 00:13:45,797
Then what happened?

2267
00:13:56,937 --> 00:13:58,647
Please tell me.

2268
00:13:58,647 --> 00:13:59,607
No.

2269
00:14:00,607 --> 00:14:01,937
I can't.

2270
00:14:01,937 --> 00:14:02,947
Oh.

2271
00:14:02,947 --> 00:14:04,607
You're worried about Bruce and Gatalie.

2272
00:14:04,947 --> 00:14:06,487
They're fine.

2273
00:14:06,987 --> 00:14:09,537
I've made a few modifications, actually.

2274
00:14:10,237 --> 00:14:12,537
Nothing will get passed on to anyone.

2275
00:14:12,537 --> 00:14:14,707
Grandfather wouldn't permit something like that-

2276
00:14:15,367 --> 00:14:17,037
It's our secret.

2277
00:14:18,417 --> 00:14:20,837
Even before being your primary care physician,

2278
00:14:20,837 --> 00:14:22,837
I am your friend.

2279
00:14:23,467 --> 00:14:25,127
You'll trust me,

2280
00:14:25,127 --> 00:14:26,087
right,

2281
00:14:26,757 --> 00:14:27,637
Re-l?

2282
00:14:29,927 --> 00:14:31,557
You won't tell anyone?

2283
00:14:32,017 --> 00:14:33,057
Of course not.

2284
00:14:34,677 --> 00:14:36,057
I found it...

2285
00:14:36,437 --> 00:14:38,057
PROXY's corpse.

2286
00:14:39,107 --> 00:14:41,107
Not even the Security Bureau knows yet.

2287
00:14:42,147 --> 00:14:43,607
That's the monster that Raul is looking for

2288
00:14:43,607 --> 00:14:46,817
while keeping it a secret from even the Intelligence Bureau.

2289
00:14:48,567 --> 00:14:50,117
I need a favor.

2290
00:14:50,117 --> 00:14:51,947
Please analyze it and tell me what you find.

2291
00:14:53,997 --> 00:14:55,907
Grandfather also kept it a secret.

2292
00:14:55,907 --> 00:14:59,207
I want to find out what it is for
 myself with my own two eyes and feet.

2293
00:14:59,497 --> 00:15:03,087
Knowing may not necessarily make you happy-

2294
00:15:03,087 --> 00:15:04,207
I don't care.

2295
00:15:04,837 --> 00:15:06,047
Please,

2296
00:15:06,047 --> 00:15:07,177
Daedalus.

2297
00:15:11,757 --> 00:15:13,007
Fine.

2298
00:15:13,637 --> 00:15:15,637
I'll do as you say.

2299
00:15:15,637 --> 00:15:18,187
Will you tell me where it is?

2300
00:15:36,617 --> 00:15:37,957
Without a doubt,

2301
00:15:37,957 --> 00:15:39,747
I fell from there.

2302
00:15:40,627 --> 00:15:43,037
Chased by a monster,

2303
00:15:43,037 --> 00:15:46,047
framed for a crime, and treated as a rebel...

2304
00:15:47,167 --> 00:15:48,717
A monster, you say?

2305
00:15:49,967 --> 00:15:51,677
So you saw it?

2306
00:15:52,347 --> 00:15:53,007
"It..."

2307
00:15:54,097 --> 00:15:55,557
You know of it?

2308
00:15:56,467 --> 00:15:57,727
It...

2309
00:16:01,477 --> 00:16:02,767
They...

2310
00:16:02,767 --> 00:16:05,817
are demons born from the enraged land.

2311
00:16:17,157 --> 00:16:22,667
<u>Note:</u> In Hindu and Buddhist mythology, Amrita is the drink of the gods, which           grants them immortality. The word itself literally means "without death".

2312
00:16:17,497 --> 00:16:20,367
The supposedly immortal amrita cells...

2313
00:16:20,367 --> 00:16:21,617
actually died?

2314
00:16:21,617 --> 00:16:22,667
What do you think?

2315
00:16:22,667 --> 00:16:24,207
Er, well...

2316
00:16:25,167 --> 00:16:28,547
I'll have to take it back to the lab and
 run tests before I can make any guesses.

2317
00:16:30,087 --> 00:16:31,337
You knew.

2318
00:16:33,837 --> 00:16:36,177
You would be better off forgetting

2319
00:16:36,177 --> 00:16:37,967
everything you've seen here.

2320
00:16:38,677 --> 00:16:40,637
This is PROXY, isn't it?

2321
00:16:41,727 --> 00:16:42,807
And...

2322
00:16:42,807 --> 00:16:45,557
There is another monster

2323
00:16:45,897 --> 00:16:47,567
that killed this one.

2324
00:16:52,027 --> 00:16:53,817
It should be alive somewhere.

2325
00:16:53,817 --> 00:16:54,867
You-

2326
00:16:54,867 --> 00:16:55,907
Re-l.

2327
00:16:55,907 --> 00:16:57,827
You know, don't you, Daedalus?

2328
00:17:00,077 --> 00:17:01,117
I'm sorry.

2329
00:17:01,117 --> 00:17:02,917
Of course you can't talk about it.

2330
00:17:02,917 --> 00:17:04,167
No, I-

2331
00:17:04,167 --> 00:17:05,957
It's all right, Daedalus.

2332
00:17:06,497 --> 00:17:09,127
I guess I got you into trouble.

2333
00:17:10,877 --> 00:17:13,797
I just want you to let me handle the rest.

2334
00:17:14,377 --> 00:17:16,547
So, please promise me.

2335
00:17:16,547 --> 00:17:19,347
You never found anything here.

2336
00:17:20,017 --> 00:17:20,927
Nope.

2337
00:17:20,927 --> 00:17:24,517
You could even say that I've never been here before.

2338
00:17:25,647 --> 00:17:26,727
That's good.

2339
00:17:27,397 --> 00:17:29,227
Well, I'll leave the rest to you.

2340
00:17:29,227 --> 00:17:31,687
Please prepare a dossier when the results come out.

2341
00:17:31,687 --> 00:17:33,237
I'll come ask you about them next time.

2342
00:17:33,817 --> 00:17:34,857
Where are you going?

2343
00:17:36,617 --> 00:17:37,947
I told you, didn't I?

2344
00:17:37,947 --> 00:17:39,277
I want to investigate on my own.

2345
00:17:39,907 --> 00:17:43,537
There is an escape route over here
 that only infected autoreivs know about.

2346
00:17:44,037 --> 00:17:45,417
I am going beyond that route.

2347
00:17:47,127 --> 00:17:48,127
Re-l...

2348
00:18:04,427 --> 00:18:06,647
I hear you're an immigrant.

2349
00:18:07,347 --> 00:18:09,727
I guess Romdeau didn't suit you.

2350
00:18:09,727 --> 00:18:10,977
I know how you feel.

2351
00:18:10,977 --> 00:18:12,817
You're welcome here, then.

2352
00:18:12,817 --> 00:18:15,317
Stay as long as you want.

2353
00:18:15,647 --> 00:18:17,277
There is freedom here.

2354
00:18:17,777 --> 00:18:21,577
We left the dome and won true freedom.

2355
00:18:23,697 --> 00:18:24,867
What's that?

2356
00:18:24,867 --> 00:18:27,917
At the dome, they toss what they don't need anymore.

2357
00:18:28,417 --> 00:18:30,837
But most of it is still useful.

2358
00:18:30,837 --> 00:18:32,877
I found this too!

2359
00:18:45,847 --> 00:18:49,767
People here have left Romdeau for various reasons

2360
00:18:49,767 --> 00:18:51,517
or have been exiled from the city.

2361
00:18:52,317 --> 00:18:55,737
As a result, there are many who are hostile towards Romdeau,

2362
00:18:55,737 --> 00:18:59,567
although there are some who wish to go back.

2363
00:18:59,567 --> 00:19:00,527
But,

2364
00:19:00,867 --> 00:19:03,077
it's said that you can never go back.

2365
00:19:03,077 --> 00:19:04,617
Who said that?

2366
00:19:04,617 --> 00:19:06,867
A lady I met over that way.

2367
00:19:06,867 --> 00:19:08,287
Quinn?

2368
00:19:08,287 --> 00:19:09,747
That bitch.

2369
00:19:09,747 --> 00:19:12,377
Come to think of it, the old man was saying

2370
00:19:12,377 --> 00:19:15,297
that this one was a top-of-the-line luxury item.

2371
00:19:15,297 --> 00:19:18,627
I bet high-class citizens were using her.

2372
00:19:18,627 --> 00:19:23,007
Then maybe they'll come for this "lost-and-found", eh Miss?

2373
00:19:24,557 --> 00:19:25,717
Vince!

2374
00:19:29,187 --> 00:19:30,807
I'm just kidding.

2375
00:19:30,807 --> 00:19:33,397
Who'd go back to a place like that, anyhow?

2376
00:19:33,397 --> 00:19:34,227
Right?

2377
00:19:34,227 --> 00:19:35,727
True enough.

2378
00:19:35,727 --> 00:19:37,397
True enough.

2379
00:19:41,567 --> 00:19:43,117
True enough!

2380
00:19:43,117 --> 00:19:44,327
True enough!

2381
00:19:58,707 --> 00:20:00,087
What am I going to do now?

2382
00:20:02,627 --> 00:20:04,597
So you're the one with Pino-chan?

2383
00:20:08,717 --> 00:20:10,097
I'm Quinn.

2384
00:20:10,557 --> 00:20:13,897
As you can see, I pick up stuff that's been tossed into the ocean.

2385
00:20:13,897 --> 00:20:15,437
It's a pretty good steal, you know.

2386
00:20:15,437 --> 00:20:18,357
It's warm in the bay from the dome's waste heat energy too.

2387
00:20:18,647 --> 00:20:19,647
That's an-

2388
00:20:19,647 --> 00:20:20,937
You know what it is?

2389
00:20:20,937 --> 00:20:23,067
It's an autoreiv's core.

2390
00:20:23,067 --> 00:20:24,907
This one's a water-proof model,

2391
00:20:24,907 --> 00:20:27,367
and can be used as the Rabbit's transmission system.

2392
00:20:27,367 --> 00:20:28,407
"Rabbit"?

2393
00:20:28,407 --> 00:20:29,367
Right.

2394
00:20:29,947 --> 00:20:33,787
I'm not so spineless that I'd stick around here forever.

2395
00:20:35,747 --> 00:20:37,207
You seem to be thinking that I'm brash

2396
00:20:37,207 --> 00:20:39,457
because I'm blabbering so soon after we met.

2397
00:20:39,457 --> 00:20:40,877
I'm not-

2398
00:20:41,207 --> 00:20:43,377
You might have heard from Hoody,

2399
00:20:43,377 --> 00:20:45,177
but I'm known to be a weirdo.

2400
00:20:45,177 --> 00:20:46,137
But you know...

2401
00:20:46,717 --> 00:20:48,137
from my point of view,

2402
00:20:48,137 --> 00:20:50,967
the guys who are going on and on about being free

2403
00:20:51,517 --> 00:20:53,887
are the real weirdos.

2404
00:20:56,267 --> 00:20:56,897
Well,

2405
00:20:57,267 --> 00:21:02,487
I don't intend on living as a dome parasite forever.

2406
00:21:02,487 --> 00:21:03,897
Remember that.

2407
00:21:03,897 --> 00:21:04,857
Okay...

2408
00:21:05,447 --> 00:21:06,567
And you?

2409
00:21:07,527 --> 00:21:10,987
You've got your arms around your knees, moping and sulking.

2410
00:21:11,947 --> 00:21:13,077
Nothing.

2411
00:21:13,077 --> 00:21:15,327
Pino-chan's acting a lot more mature than you.

2412
00:21:15,327 --> 00:21:17,077
That might be right.

2413
00:21:17,747 --> 00:21:18,667
Well,

2414
00:21:18,667 --> 00:21:21,337
you'll get used to life here before long.

2415
00:21:21,337 --> 00:21:24,087
Take your time and figure out what you want to do...

2416
00:21:24,587 --> 00:21:25,677
Damn.

2417
00:21:26,007 --> 00:21:27,007
Run!

2418
00:21:27,587 --> 00:21:28,677
What's that?

2419
00:21:29,097 --> 00:21:30,217
A surveillance unit.

2420
00:21:30,217 --> 00:21:31,427
C'mon, hurry up!

2421
00:21:44,647 --> 00:21:46,107
Surveillance units?

2422
00:21:46,107 --> 00:21:48,237
Romdeau's unmanned scouting ships.

2423
00:21:48,737 --> 00:21:52,487
It takes the trouble of taking the
 same route at the same time every day.

2424
00:21:53,237 --> 00:21:56,157
But as long as it doesn't find you, people won't look for you.

2425
00:21:56,157 --> 00:21:57,117
Well,

2426
00:21:57,117 --> 00:21:59,997
that's about how much we're worth to Romdeau.

2427
00:22:01,167 --> 00:22:01,997
Pino!

2428
00:22:01,997 --> 00:22:03,377
That idiot!

2429
00:22:03,837 --> 00:22:04,837
W-Wait!

2430
00:22:04,837 --> 00:22:06,087
Autoreivs are...

2431
00:22:30,157 --> 00:22:31,697
Pino, get down!

2432
00:22:45,297 --> 00:22:46,207
Hey,

2433
00:22:46,207 --> 00:22:49,967
I thought surveillance units don't shoot autoreivs.

2434
00:22:49,967 --> 00:22:52,637
I hope this doesn't turn into trouble.

2435
00:23:04,017 --> 00:23:05,147
This man...

2436
00:23:05,607 --> 00:23:07,227
He is Vincent Law.

2437
00:23:07,227 --> 00:23:08,857
What are your orders?

2438
00:23:08,857 --> 00:23:11,107
Why is he alive?

2439
00:23:11,107 --> 00:23:13,527
Will you report this to the Administrator?

2440
00:23:13,527 --> 00:23:14,157
No.

2441
00:23:14,737 --> 00:23:16,157
I'm sure he wouldn't be interested.

2442
00:23:17,197 --> 00:23:19,617
Instead, reinforce the patrol units.

2443
00:23:19,617 --> 00:23:21,327
They are already on standby.

2444
00:23:21,617 --> 00:23:23,127
Beautiful.

2445
00:23:24,627 --> 00:23:27,417
Request action from the relevant authorities.

2446
00:23:27,917 --> 00:23:31,757
However, the specimen's location has yet to be determined.

2447
00:23:31,757 --> 00:23:32,887
That's irrelevant.

2448
00:23:32,887 --> 00:23:34,337
Either way,

2449
00:23:34,717 --> 00:23:37,637
that man has the answers.

2450
00:23:37,637 --> 00:23:39,387
Right now...

2451
00:23:39,977 --> 00:23:40,767
I can tell.

2452
00:23:40,767 --> 00:23:42,227
That is unusual.

2453
00:23:42,767 --> 00:23:46,897
Your emotional words, that is.

2454
00:23:47,357 --> 00:23:49,437
I am surprised as well.

2455
00:23:52,817 --> 00:23:55,777
It is as though I myself have been infected by Cogito.

2456
00:23:55,777 --> 00:23:58,407
That is a joke I cannot laugh at.

2457
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,357
Please

2458
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,357
could

2459
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,357
you

2460
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,357
stop

2461
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,357
the

2462
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,357
noise,

2463
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,357
I'm

2464
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,357
trying

2465
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,357
to

2466
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,357
get

2467
